    "recorded_at": "2026-10-22T10:08:04.284+00:00",
    "note": "Stale conditional cancel refused (417 TimestampMismatchError) and current cancel succeeded, but the amended-draft create was refused (403: probe role lacked Account select). The original stayed cancelled with no successor: the non-atomic partial state. Recovered manually in P06c after granting Account select only."
